      "completeAnswer": "### 1. Executive Definition & Core Principles\nDetailed academic explanation of Forward Propagation: Concept, Sequence & Information Flow.\n\n### 2. Comprehensive Theoretical Mechanism & Architecture\nIn university descriptive examinations, answering 'Explain forward propagation.' involves analyzing layer-wise transformations, matrix formulations, and forward signal flow.\n\n### 3. Mathematical Formulation & Key Equations\n$$A^{[l]} = g^{[l]}(W^{[l]} A^{[l-1]} + b^{[l]})$$\n- Provides the exact analytical relationship governing parameter trajectories and loss gradients.\n\n### 4. Key Examination Takeaways & Practical Insights\n- **Input-to-Output Information Flow**: Input-to-Output Information Flow\n- **Mathematical Matrix Representation**:  Z^[l] = W^[l] A^[l-1] + b^[l]\n- **Affine Projection followed by Pointwise Non-linearity**: Affine Projection followed by Pointwise Non-linearity\n- **Computational Complexity & Storage for Backward Pass Caching**: Computational Complexity & Storage for Backward Pass Caching"
