      "completeAnswer": "### 1. Executive Definition & Core Principles\nDetailed academic analysis of Feed-Forward Neural Network: Definition and Structural Topology.\n\n### 2. Comprehensive Theoretical Mechanism & Architecture\nIn university examinations, answering 'Define a feed-forward neural network.' involves analyzing parameter counting, FLOP scaling, memory complexity, and hardware optimization.\n\n### 3. Mathematical Formulation & Key Equations\n$$\\text{FLOPs} \\approx 2 \\cdot n_{in} \\cdot n_{out} \\cdot B$$\n- Dictates the analytical relationship governing representations and gradients.\n\n### 4. Key Examination Takeaways & Practical Insights\n- **Dense Layer Dimensionality & Weight Matrix Layout**: Dense Layer Dimensionality & Weight Matrix Layout\n- **Parameter Formula**:  (N_in * N_out) weights + N_out biases\n- **Computational Complexity**:  O(N_in * N_out * BatchSize) FLOPs\n- **Hardware Execution**:  GPU Tensor Cores & Shared Memory Tiling"
