        "Biases b₁ = 50.",
        "Subtotal = 1,050.",
        "2. Layer 2 (50 -> 100):",
        "Weights W₂ = 50 × 100 = 5,000.",
        "Biases b₂ = 100.",
        "Subtotal = 5,100.",
        "3. Layer 3 (100 -> 10):",
