      "completeAnswer": "### 1. Executive Definition & Core Principles\nRigorous theoretical analysis of The Dying ReLU Pathology: Mechanical Causes & Preventive Countermeasures.\n\n### 2. Comprehensive Theoretical Mechanism & Architecture\nIn advanced deep learning examinations, answering 'Why can ReLU neurons die?' demands formal mathematical proofs, geometric explanations, optimization dynamics, and theoretical references (e.g. He et al., Glorot & Bengio, Srivastava et al.).\n\n### 3. Mathematical Formulation & Key Equations\n$$\\mathcal{L}_{gen} = \\mathbb{E}_{(x,y)\\sim \\mathcal{D}}[L(f(x; \\theta), y)]$$\n- Dictates the analytical relationship governing representations and gradients.\n\n### 4. Key Examination Takeaways & Practical Insights\n- **Mathematical Statement & Formal Foundation**: Mathematical Statement & Formal Foundation\n- **Analytical Proof / Derivation**: Analytical Proof / Derivation\n- **Failure Modes Under Suboptimal Conditions**: Failure Modes Under Suboptimal Conditions\n- **Practical Architectural and Training Guidelines**: Practical Architectural and Training Guidelines"
